[31m-## Features ✨️    [m
[31m-- Play music from YouTube Music or YouTube for free, without ads and in the background[m
[31m-- Three Now Playing styles: Classic, Material 3 Expressive and a redesigned Apple Music player with Apple Music-style lyrics (NEW)[m
[31m-- Ten-band equalizer with presets and AutoEq headphone profiles, plus Delay and Reverb effects, or your phone's system equalizer on Android (NEW)[m
[31m-- Pick the speaker, headphones or Cast device SimpMusic plays on, without moving other apps' audio (NEW)[m
[31m-- SimpMusic Wrapped: your year in music, plus monthly recap playlists (NEW)[m
[31m-- On-device listening analytics: charts, period history, listening clock and a shareable listening receipt (NEW)[m
[31m-- Word-by-word Apple Music-style lyrics, romanization for 12 languages, share lyrics as an image, landscape fullscreen lyrics and a timing offset (NEW)[m
[31m-- Home screen widgets: turntable, playlists and listening insights (NEW)[m
[31m-- Send your sign-ins from Android to Desktop by scanning a QR code (NEW)[m
[31m-- Preferred audio language for videos with several audio tracks (NEW)[m
[31m-- High quality up-to 256kbps stream (Opus or AAC) for YouTube Music Premium users[m
[31m-- Browsing Home, Charts, Podcast, Moods & Genre with YouTube Music data at high speed    [m
[31m-- Search everything on YouTube    [m
[31m-- Spotify Canvas and Animated Album Art supported (NEW)[m
[31m-- Power your experience with SimpMusic Chart (https://chart.simpmusic.org/)[m
[31m-- Play 1080p video option with subtitle    [m
[31m-- Play YouTube Music live stations (NEW)[m
[31m-- AI song suggestions and an AI reading of your music taste (NEW)[m
[31m-- Import playlists converted from Spotify and other apps[m
[31m-- Customize your playlist, synced with YouTube Music[m
[31m-- Notifications from followed artists    [m
[31m-- Caching and offline playback support    [m
[31m-- Crossfade with DJ-style like Apple Music[m
[31m-- Customizing THEME (Light, Dark, Color, etc)[m
[31m-- Synced lyrics from SimpMusic Lyrics, LRCLIB, Spotify (require login) and YouTube Transcript - AI lyrics translation (BETA) (\*)  [m
[31m-- Personalize data (\**) and multi-YouTube-account support    [m
[31m-- Last.fm scrobbling (Full version)[m
[31m-- Supports SponsorBlock and Return YouTube Dislike[m
[31m-- Sleep Timer    [m
[31m-- Android Auto with online content, feature rich UI/UX[m
[31m-- Discord Rich Presence support[m
[31m-- Listen Together: shared rooms that play in sync with friends, compatible with Metrolist (NEW)[m
[31m-- And many more!    [m
