[31m- ## Data    [m
[31m-- This app uses hidden API from YouTube Music with some tricks to get data from YouTube Music.    [m
[31m-- Use Spotify Web API and some tricks to get Spotify Canvas and Lyrics    [m
[31m-- Thanks to [InnerTune](https://github.com/z-huang/InnerTune/) for the idea to get data from YouTube Music. This repo is my inspiration to create this app.    [m
[31m-- Special thanks to [SmartTube](https://github.com/yuliskov/SmartTube). This repo help me to extract the streaming URL of YouTube Music.    [m
[31m-- My app is using [SponsorBlock](https://sponsor.ajay.app/) to skip sponsor in YouTube videos.    [m
[31m-- ReturnYouTubeDislike for getting information on votes [m
[31m-- Main lyrics data from SimpMusic Lyrics[m
[31m-- Alternative lyrics data from LRCLIB. More information [LRCLIB](https://lrclib.net/)    [m
[31m- [m
[31m- ## Privacy    [m
[31m- SimpMusic doesn't have any tracker or third-party server for collecting user data in FOSS version. If YouTube      [m
[31m-logged-in users enable "Send back to Google" feature, SimpMusic only uses YouTube Music Tracking API to send listening history and listening record of video to Google for better recommendations and      [m
[31m-supporting artist or YouTube Creator (For API reference,      [m
[31m-see [this](https://github.com/maxrave-dev/core/blob/master/service/kotlinYtmusicScraper/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/maxrave/kotlinytmusicscraper/Ytmusic.kt)).[m
